cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use crypto-service-sdk-python in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "crypto-service-sdk-python: a typed Python client for the Crypto Service REST API"
abstract: >-
  An async and blocking Python client for the crypto-server REST API of
  the Crypto Service suite: hashing, AEAD, server-held Ed25519, ML-KEM,
  ML-DSA, SLH-DSA, HPKE and KMS keys, with no cryptography in the client.
  It is proven against the server by the Crypto Service conformance kit.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.40"
# Dual-licensed, at the user's option (LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-MIT).
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/crypto-service-sdk-python"
url: "https://crypto-service.co"
keywords:
  - cryptography
  - post-quantum
  - ml-kem
  - ml-dsa
  - hpke
  - Python
  - SDK
